flowchart TB
  pw[New password] --> len{12 to 128 chars?}
  len --> name{contains the username?}
  name --> same{same as the current one?}
  same --> words{only guessable site words?}
  words --> hibp[Have I Been Pwned range: 5 hex chars out]
  hibp -->|leaked| reject[reject with the failed rules]
  hibp -->|ok or unreachable| save[hash with Argon2id, sign out other devices]
